                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div className="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <span>Optimal kidney function and toxin elimination</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-start gap-3">
